---
source: crates/rustman-cli/src/tests.rs
expression: help
---
Create this workspace's local CA (key in the OS keychain, certificate in the user config directory); it is not trusted until `ca install`

Usage: rustman record ca init [OPTIONS]

Options:
      --workspace <DIR>
          Workspace whose CA to use (default: search from the current directory upwards)

      --color <WHEN>
          Color: auto (a terminal without NO_COLOR or TERM=dumb), always or never
          
          [default: auto]

  -v, --verbose...
          Log more on stderr: -v requests, -vv headers, -vvv everything (RUST_LOG, when set, replaces these levels)

  -h, --help
          Print help
